# Give the VLM agent one natural-language task and run its tool-use loop to
# completion (served by vlm_agent_node.py). The task is appended to the
# agent's ongoing conversation — earlier run_task calls in the same node
# lifetime are still in context, so a follow-up task can refer back to
# what an earlier one found. Returns the VLM's final text answer plus the
# shared plan/state JSON as it stood when the loop ended.
string task
---
bool success
string answer        # the VLM's final text response
string plan_json      # the plan/state JSON (see PlanState in vlm_agent_node.py)
